      "value": "<p>The caster emulates a cie’th cocytus’s ability to unleash several blasts of electricity. The caster can make a series of four ranged touch attacks within 100 ft., each one doing 5d8 points of lightning damage and inflicting the Dazzled and Static conditions for 2d4 rounds, a successful Fortitude save negates the status effects. Upon a failed Fortitude save, those struck are also stunned for 1 round. Learned From C ie’th Cocytus and Ser Hermenost</p>"
